          title: "Mobile Engineer",
          org: "Netsells (part of hedgehog lab) · Remote",
          date: "Aug 2022 - Nov 2023",
          intro:
            "Delivered cross-platform iOS and Android apps for medical and fintech clients as part of a cross-functional agency team, and contributed to the Laravel and PHP services behind them.",
          bullets: [
