        },
        {
          title:
            "<a href='https://rate-stuff.online/' target='_blank' rel='noopener'>rate-stuff.online</a>",
          intro:
            "Built a social platform for rating and reviewing anything you can think of, with real-time updates, image uploads, and a personalized explore feed. It runs on TypeScript, React 19, TanStack Start/Router/Query, and Tailwind CSS on Cloudflare Workers, over PostgreSQL (CockroachDB through Cloudflare Hyperdrive) with Drizzle ORM and PartyKit WebSockets, plus auth, an image CDN, and transactional email.",
