          intro:
            "Built my portfolio and blog, designed after vim and terminal UIs, on Astro and Tailwind CSS running on Cloudflare Workers. Static pages plus a few Worker routes, including a double opt-in newsletter that runs on Resend with no database behind it, MDX blog posts, an RSS feed, and structured data for SEO.",
        },
        {
          title:
